    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present No. 37 Sundale Grove to the market. No.37 is an attractive 3 bed, 2 bath semi-detached family home, presented in fantastic condition throughout having been well decorated & lovingly maintained by its current owners.\nInternal accommodation of c. 81 sqm comprises of an entrance hallway, spacious living room, kitchen/dining area, separate utility room, 3 large bedrooms, one with an ensuite and a main family bathroom.\nThe property is further enhanced by a low maintenance, north facing rear garden.\nIdeally located, Sundale is situated close to a range of essential amenities. Well established primary and secondary schools are located very nearby with several bus routes also servicing the area. Both The Citywest Shopping Centre and The Square are only a short drive away and offer a range of exceptional shopping outlets and eateries, with the LUAS also within a stone's throw.\nEarly viewing is highly advised, contact RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS to arrange a viewing today!\n\nFeatures\n- 3 bed, 2 bath\n- Semi-detached\n- Gas fired central heating\n- Double glazed windows throughout\n- North facing private rear garden\n- Well presented throughout\n- Generous driveway to front offers off-street parking for multiple vehicles\n- Easy access to major routes & road networks\n- A host of amenities on your doorstep\n- Early viewing highly advised!\n\nBER details\nBER: D2\n\nDirections\nEircode: D24 F5XF"
      },
      {
